[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚和安安，还有梅露露都没来。<br>不过可可倒是来了。|#0102Adv04_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可坐在离其他人稍远的椅子上，<br>正无精打采地玩手机。|#0102Adv04_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

