@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格，今天喊我们来图书室有什么事……？|#0102Adv04_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR1,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵呵，不用那么警惕。<br>今天我不是来推销的。|#0102Adv04_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:我翻了一圈图书室里的书，<br>找到本很有意思的书，<br>所以想给大家也看一看。|#0102Adv04_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（玛格虽然看起来悠哉游哉的……<br>　但说不定其实她行动力很强……）|#0102Adv04_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:自从大家被抓到监狱以来，<br>玛格似乎是精力最充沛的那个，<br>她做的事也是最有意义的。|#0102Adv04_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（也许玛格比我<br>　更适合做队长………）|#0102Adv04_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛摇摇头，<br>赶走脑海中浮现的想法。|#0102Adv04_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（现在想那么多也没有用……！<br>　好不容易争取到了玛格的协助）|#0102Adv04_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:你说的是什么书？|#0102Adv04_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:就是这本。|#0102Adv04_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; 机に本を置く音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_42 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

; ========================================
; アイテムスチル：『魔女の本』表示
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格放在桌上的书<br>装帧豪华，十分厚重。|#0102Adv04_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:上面记载了有关魔女的知识。目前，<br>我只找到了这一本和魔女有关的书。|#0102Adv04_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:这样啊，让我看看。|#0102Adv04_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; 本のページをぱらぱらめくる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_43 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉翻开书，哗啦啦地翻了起来。<br>这时汉娜却有些着急了。|#0102Adv04_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:可、可以请你不要那样粗暴地翻阅吗！？<br>书都要被你弄坏了哦！？|#0102Adv04_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Angry1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……你把我当成什么人了？|#0102Adv04_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:不过话说回来，我看不懂这本书耶。|#0102Adv04_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛也兴趣盎然地看起书来。|#0102Adv04_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:510_1

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_36_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵呵。怎样？这文字很奇特吧？|#0102Adv04_Margo005| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格，难道你能看得懂！？|#0102Adv04_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不，我看不懂。|#0102Adv04_Margo006| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格愉快地扑哧一笑。|#0102Adv04_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但这本书里有很多图解。<br>所以我才知道书上写了和魔女有关的东西。|#0102Adv04_Margo007| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你看，这张图画的<br>是不是我们的魔法。|#0102Adv04_Margo008| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:5,3.5 Zoom:0.5 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:啊！真的耶！<br>这张画上的女孩有一点飘起来了！|#0102Adv04_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那张老旧的插图<br>画有一位飘在空中的少女。|#0102Adv04_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:5,-1 Zoom:0.5 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:而它旁边的那张画，<br>好像是一位少女在空中滑翔。|#0102Adv04_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我就说很有意思吧？<br>能从中解读出我们的魔法会怎样进化。|#0102Adv04_Margo009| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果这本书的内容没错的话……<br>那我的魔法变强以后<br>就可以飞得更高了！|#0102Adv04_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:等你的魔法变强<br>说不定能飞过围墙……！|#0102Adv04_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜和艾玛似乎寻觅到了一丝希望，<br>她们两眼放光地看向彼此。|#0102Adv04_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……？可是，魔法变强的话，<br>也就意味着进一步魔女化吧……？|#0102Adv04_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呃，说、说得也对……<br>我可不想变成【残骸】……|#0102Adv04_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不仅会加重杀意，还会危及我们的生命。<br>这可不是个好主意。|#0102Adv04_Margo010| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:0,0 Zoom:0 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:还是不行啊……|#0102Adv04_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛感到很失落，<br>她想找到新的线索，<br>目光又回到书上。|#0102Adv04_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:-4,1 Zoom:0.4 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:这时她看见一幅图解。图画上，众多魔女手牵手围在一起，<br>而一名威严十足的魔女正在降临。|#0102Adv04_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这个人，是不是类似于魔女的领袖……？|#0102Adv04_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:恐怕是的。<br>在常见的传说中，魔女也都是有领袖的。|#0102Adv04_Margo011| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:统治所有魔女的领袖——【大魔女】。|#0102Adv04_Margo012| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"这幅图解是【<ruby=\"Sabbath\">魔女的安息日</ruby>】吗？<br>看起来像是魔女们在召唤大魔女。|#0102Adv04_Margo013|" AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果能解读出文字的话，<br>就能知道更详细的内容了。|#0102Adv04_Margo014| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（大魔女……难道那就是幕后黑手……？）|#0102Adv04_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:0,0 Zoom:0 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的脑海中浮现出<br>米莉亚的身影。<br>她连忙甩开这个念头。|#0102Adv04_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（只是奈叶香怀疑她而已，<br>　米莉亚也不一定就是幕后黑手）|#0102Adv04_Ema011|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills Lazy:false

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格叹了口气将书合上，<br>看向艾玛她们。|#0102Adv04_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我想和大家商量的就是，<br>虽然汉娜的魔法没法指望，<br>不过我们也许可以用其他魔法越狱。|#0102Adv04_Margo015| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_19_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:对哦……！<br>我们再确认一遍各自的魔法吧。|#0102Adv04_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:呃，抱歉……我连自己的魔法<br>都搞不清楚是什么……|#0102Adv04_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉举起手，劲头十足地抢先发言。|#0102Adv04_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR16

[PrintTextModified Text:我的魔法是怪力！|#0102Adv04_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR10

[PrintTextModified Text:但那堵围墙可能是施了什么魔法，<br>连我的能力都无法破坏，<br>也没办法爬上去。|#0102Adv04_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格你的魔法是什么呢！？|#0102Adv04_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格轻轻吐了口气，耸耸肩说。|#0102Adv04_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我可以自由变换自己的声音。<br>比如像这样——|#0102Adv04_Margo016| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1,ArmR6
; 桜羽エマのボイス
; ＠桜羽エマ

[PrintTextModified Text:我是樱羽艾玛！|#0102Adv04_Margo017| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格发出的声音<br>和艾玛一模一样。|#0102Adv04_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在场的所有人都惊呆了。<br>唯独玛格一人脸色有些阴郁。|#0102Adv04_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:对不起，我只有这种无聊的模仿能力。<br>在越狱这件事上完全派不上用场吧？|#0102Adv04_Margo018| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@UpdateWitchBook Id:Margo Category:Profile Version:2
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格似乎不太中意自己的能力。<br>其他人也不知该如何接话。|#0102Adv04_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，远处的可可<br>阴阳怪气地哈哈大笑起来。|#0102Adv04_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

