[PrintTextModified Text:真的假的？你超适合当主播啊！<br>不如去当模仿艺人怎样？|#0102Adv04_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:哼，竟敢嘲笑别人的能力，<br>想必你的魔法一定很了不得吧？|#0102Adv04_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmL11 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:你说我吗？我的魔法是——【千里眼】。|#0102Adv04_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR10,ArmL5 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:可可一转平时的欢脱模样，<br>愁眉苦脸着站了起来。|#0102Adv04_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:千、千里眼……？<br>莫非你一直在监视我们……？|#0102Adv04_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只不过，我只能对正在看我的人<br>使用这个能力。|#0102Adv04_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:无论通过直播还是照片，只要认知到了是泽渡可可这个人，<br>我就能用俯瞰视角看到对方。|#0102Adv04_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:这样啊……那就好～<br>请、请你不要吓我们好吗。|#0102Adv04_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……所以可可她<br>　才会经常做直播啊……）|#0102Adv04_Ema014|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@UpdateWitchBook Id:Coco Category:Profile Version:2
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmL1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:只要有人看我的直播，不管这人在哪里<br>我都能随意看个够啦……|#0102Adv04_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:什么狗屁魔法！！一点用也没有！！<br>开了直播也没人来看啊！！|#0102Adv04_Coco006| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可突然情绪激动起来，<br>吓得艾玛她们肩膀一抖。|#0102Adv04_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:还以为你们找到了什么好办法，结果过来一听，<br>都是些废话！！|#0102Adv04_Coco007| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我的魔法和你们的魔法全都派不上用场！！<br>到底该怎么逃出去啊！！|#0102Adv04_Coco008| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:快点找到办法啊！！<br>我想赶紧离开这破地方！！|#0102Adv04_Coco009| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:可大家也都是这么想的呀……！|#0102Adv04_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:烦死了！！<br>我是真的想出去！！|#0102Adv04_Coco010| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:怒上心头的可可气得直跺脚，<br>脸皱作一团。|#0102Adv04_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:人家……是真的……<br>好想赶紧逃出这里……！|#0102Adv04_Coco011| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:得赶紧逃出去才行……|#0102Adv04_Coco012| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

