[PrintTextModified Text:可可从喉咙里挤出悲痛的呢喃，<br>转身离开了图书馆。|#0102Adv04_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:好担心可可啊……<br>感觉她积攒了很多压力。|#0102Adv04_Margo019| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（大家的忍耐都快到极限了……<br>　随时都有可能变成魔女）|#0102Adv04_Ema015|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（可是，玛格的【模仿】<br>　和可可的【千里眼】对越狱都没太大帮助）|#0102Adv04_Ema016|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛在脑海中<br>再度回顾少女们的魔法。|#0102Adv04_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——玛格的【模仿】，<br>——可可的【千里眼】，<br>——奈叶香的【幻视】。|#0102Adv04_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——雪莉的【怪力】，<br>——汉娜的【飘浮】，<br>——梅露露的【治愈】。|#0102Adv04_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——米莉亚的【互换】，<br>——安安的【洗脑】，<br>——亚里沙的【点火】。|#0102Adv04_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（所有人的魔法我已经大致了解了……<br>　但要说哪个能用来越狱，<br>　可能就只有汉娜的【飘浮】了……）|#0102Adv04_Ema017|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:翻开的书页映入艾玛的眼帘，<br>上面画着自由自在飞翔在无垠蓝天的魔女。|#0102Adv04_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……如果我们也能像这样自由地飞在空中，<br>　一定很快乐吧）|#0102Adv04_Ema018|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（但我们可以通过发展科学，<br>　从而自由地飞上天空……）|#0102Adv04_Ema019|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

